# Code owners for bounded-systems/.github.
#
# This routes review requests. It does NOT gate merges: the active `~ALL`
# ruleset carries `require_code_owner_review: false`, and turning that on would
# not help — the team below has one member, who authors nearly every PR here,
# and GitHub does not permit approving your own. CONTRIBUTING.md states the
# same thing outward; the reasoning is in .github-private docs/merge-gate.md.
#
# What DOES gate merges here is the required `schema` check (ci-green-dot-github).
# The gate is the check, not the approval.
#
# Validity is not self-evident: a team is only a valid owner if it has write
# access to this repo. Check https://github.com/bounded-systems/.github/codeowners
# after any change — an invalid entry is silently ignored, which looks exactly
# like a file that works.

* @bounded-systems/maintainers
